@ Hammer Flower power-up. Deluxe (Switch) v1.0.0 only.
@ Every entry below is a `push`, position-independent, so each trampoline can
@ replay it (sdk/data/hookable.csv; 0x0045DDC0 checked in the disassembly).

@ Player::createFireBall (0x007AABA0) is hooked once, by framework/player
@ (modbase/throws.h); the mod registers a throw handler there.

@ Fire Flower per-frame collect check (vtable +0xE0): sub_60463998(item, &out, 2, 1)
HammerFlower_grant:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0045DDC0
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerFlower::grant(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerFlower::grant_orig(StageActor*)

@ Fire Flower item functions that name "I_fireflower"
HammerFlower_createModel:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0045D79C
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerFlower::createModel(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerFlower::createModel_orig(StageActor*)

HammerFlower_animOut:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0045D980
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerFlower::animOut(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerFlower::animOut_orig(StageActor*)

HammerFlower_animOut3:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0045DA4C
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerFlower::animOut3(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerFlower::animOut3_orig(StageActor*)

HammerFlower_animWait:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0045DB18
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerFlower::animWait(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerFlower::animWait_orig(StageActor*)

HammerFlower_animWait2:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0045DBF8
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerFlower::animWait2(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerFlower::animWait2_orig(StageActor*)

HammerFlower_animOut2:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0045DCC4
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerFlower::animOut2(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerFlower::animOut2_orig(StageActor*)

@ The helmet and shell (code/hammer_costume.cpp) are made and drawn through
@ framework/player's model listeners (hooks/framework/player_models.hks:
@ PlayerModel::PlayerModel 0x0078C444 and PlayerModel::draw 0x0078E574).

@ HammerActor's Thrown state begin (state 0x60C87CE4, built in 0x6014083C): the
@ arc of every thrown hammer; a player's is made faster, higher and wider
@ (code/powerups/hammer_suit.cpp, HAMMER_THROW_*). Entry: push {r4-r6, lr}.
HammerSuit_thrownBegin:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0013F3D8
    symbol:     ModBase::hammerSuit::thrownBegin(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::hammerSuit::thrownBegin_orig(StageActor*)
